../../../../../design-system/RULES.md:141:2. **Side margin:** `--tm-space-page` (**16**, the design team's standard — changed from 24 on 2026-10-26, D-67) on every mobile screen, including the header, sheets and the action bar. Every block — fields, notices, cards, code boxes, buttons — shares the same left and right edges.
../../../../../design-system/RULES.md:142:3. **Three gaps only:** tight `--tm-space-sm` (8): label↔field, field↔helper, and a result notice ↔ the button it came from (A-14). **A result notice under a field sits 16 below the field** (the field's 8 gap plus the notice's 8; D-98) · related `--tm-space-lg` (16): items within a group, **and cards stacked one above another — the same gap everywhere cards stack, on the case page, Prescribe and Profile (B-04, B-05, A-13, 2026-11-02)** · section `--tm-space-2xl` (32): between groups. Spare vertical space goes between the content and a pinned button, never inside a group.
../../../../../design-system/RULES.md:153:   - **Edit screen header** [ADDED 2026-10-15] — for a full-screen editor opened over a page (e.g. Prescribe). White bar: ✕ on the left (closes; asks before discarding unsaved changes), title 20/28 with an optional one-line subtitle, at most one action on the right (destructive outline if it removes something). A pinned summary band may sit directly under it.
../../../../../design-system/RULES.md:157:7. **Contrast:** all text meets WCAG AA (4.5:1; 3:1 for 24px+ or 18.66px+ bold) on the surface it sits on, including tinted bands and notices. Blue means "tap me" (§2.5): links are always `--tm-content-brand`, never grey-and-underlined. Disabled controls are exempt from the contrast rule (WCAG 1.4.3) and keep the design-system disabled style.
../../../../../design-system/RULES.md:163:13. **Logo lockup size and place (A-07, 2026-11-02).** Every home-base screen with the "truemeds for doctors" lockup (`brand/truemeds-for-doctors.svg`, project level, §2.8) draws it **166px wide** (height follows the 220×54 artwork), **16px from the top**, and the logo→title gap stays as in §8.3 (L6). 166 is the largest width that fits Home at 360 wide with 16 to the first header icon: 360 − 2×16 − (3 × 48 + 2 × 8 − 14 for the actions' 14px overhang) − 16 = 166. Nothing else sets the lockup size.
../../../../../design-system/RULES.md:166:### Locked specs (D-46, D-47) — set once in the design system, never per screen
../../../../../design-system/RULES.md:176:| L5 | Notice text (`.tm-notice`): 14/20. |
../../../../../design-system/RULES.md:178:| L7 | Field helper/error text aligns with its field: left under full-width fields, centred under the centred OTP code boxes (D-47). |
../../../../../design-system/RULES.md:179:| L8 | Screen titles wrap balanced — never a single word alone on the last line (D-47). |
