../../../docs/context/decision_log.md:326:### D-34 · OTP lock applies to mobile number — 2026-10-10
../../../docs/context/decision_log.md:327:- **Decision:** 5 server-confirmed wrong OTP submissions lock the attempted mobile number, not the doctor's account. The OTP screen keeps **Change number** available during the lock. Resending a code or restarting sign-in does not reset the wrong-try count.
../../../docs/context/decision_log.md:329:- **Screen consequence:** Keep the locked number's countdown and Doctor Ops action visible; disable OTP entry and verification for that number until its lock expires. Do not present this as an account-wide suspension.
../../../docs/context/decision_log.md:331:### D-35 · Configurable OTP issue cap — 2026-10-10
../../../docs/context/decision_log.md:332:- **Decision:** OTP issue cap is configurable. Start at 4 codes per mobile number in a server-enforced limit window, counting initial code and up to 3 resends. Do not reset count when the doctor restarts sign-in or changes number and returns.
